<title>USA: Ampal-American to post gain on unit sale.</title>
<headline>Ampal-American to post gain on unit sale.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ampal-American Israel Corp said on Thursday that it expects to post a $200,000 gain from the sale of its Orlite Industries Ltd stake.</p>
<p>Ampal-American said it had sold its holdings in Orlite for $5.3 million plus interest.</p>
</text>
